    "title": "Men's Better Sweater® Vest",
    "description": "This warm Patagonia fleece vest combines a sweater-knit aesthetic with the easy care of Better Sweater fleece. It comes in a regular fit. Zippered front pockets offer a cozy spot to warm your hands. It is made from 100% recycled polyester knit fleece and is dyed with a low-impact process. The vest features a full-length zipper with a stand-up collar and a zip-through collar. It has two zippered, welt handwarmer pockets and one vertically zippered left-chest security pocket, as well as an interior drop-in pocket. The vest has offset shoulder seams for pack-wearing comfort and long-lasting durability, and flat-seam construction to reduce bulk and eliminate seam chafe. Soft brushed-tricot trim on the armholes and hem adds comfort. It is imported and Fair Trade Certified™ Factory.",
